{"version":1,"key":"card:410","content":{"id":410,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果输入与输出有相同的生命周期标识，则表示输入必须活的比输出长，换句话说输出的生命的周期要小于该输入，否则如果输入先死，输出引用了输入，输出引用了一个死掉的数据，是不行的，所以输出的生命周期一定比输入短。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实际的生命周期由输入决定，并且是由生命周期最短的决定"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"fn max<'a'>(x: &'a i32, y: &'a i32) -> '&a i32 {\n  \n}","language":"Rust","uuid":"041967e4-42f4-4c8b-ac7c-3e82a9d9af94","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"'a","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的生命周期由 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"y","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 最短的那个决定，返回值的生命周期一定是短于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"y","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果结构体中的字段是引用，假设该引用的生命周期是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"'a","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么结构体的生命周期一定要小于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"'a","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，否则引用失效了，结构体还活着，通过该引用访问的是无效的数据，这是不被允许的。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以类比于函数，将结构体看作是函数的输出，将其中的引用字段看作是函数的输入，可以有多个输入，其结构体的生命周期一定要短于其中所有引用字段的生命周期，以保证访问到的数据是有效的。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["Rust/生命周期"],"createTime":1709219361718,"updateTime":1755938868497,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755938868497}}